 anything that makes the Enlightened Science of their peers cheaper, without significant loss in accuracy, is a good thing.<br /> <br /> But it's also a boon for Tradition technomancers. Imagine you're an Etherite biochemist, who struggles every day with the costs of research equipment. Suddenly, you can afford basic machines for pennies on the dollar, that you can probably built yourself in an hour. And both the Foldscope and the Paperfuge are tiny, slim things. Imagine an Etherite walking around with a fully-functioning lab <i>in her pocket</i>. All of which, thanks to publications like WIRED, is now <i>Coincidental</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, this should be Vulgar even in our world. <br /> <br /> I guess after all those publications, I'll have to be a lot more lenient with vulgar effects","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T05:33:50-08:00","id":1053766,"title":"","content":"This one is more general wod than mage, but I guess it counts.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://g1.globo.com/mato-grosso-do-sul/noticia/2017/02/mulher-e-atacada-moradores-falam-em-lobisomem-e-pm-faz-buscas.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://s2.glbimg.com/7kczMnYiOH3wt7PxX5b-HqxfyGQ=/1200x630/s.glbimg.com/jo/g1/f/original/2017/02/21/b_o_iguatemi.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://g1.globo.com/mato-grosso-do-sul/noticia/2017/02/mulher-e-atacada-moradores-falam-em-lobisomem-e-pm-faz-buscas.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Mulher &eacute; atacada, moradores falam em 'lobisomem' e PM faz buscas </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://g1.globo.com/mato-grosso-do-sul/noticia/2017/02/mulher-e-atacada-moradores-falam-em-lobisomem-e-pm-faz-buscas.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://g1.globo.com/mato-grosso-do-sul/noticia/2017/02/mulher-e-atacada-moradores-falam-em-lobisomem-e-pm-faz-buscas.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Pol&iacute;cia registrou boletim de ocorr&ecirc;ncia das buscas \"sem &ecirc;xito\". Caso aconteceu em Iguatemi (MS); moradores v&atilde;o &agrave; 'ca&ccedil;a' novamente. </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;Woman is attacked, townsfolk called the police to chase a werewolf&quot;<br /> They organize hunts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://g1.globo.com/sao-paulo/itapetininga-regiao/noticia/2015/08/empresario-diz-que-cria-17-casais-de-sacis-em-sitio-eles-aprontam-muito.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://s2.glbimg.com/c5N18N1969KtIcpZS84A5tP6xo4=/1200x630/filters:max_age(3600)/s03.video.glbimg.com/deo/vi/06/25/4422506\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://g1.globo.com/sao-paulo/itapetininga-regiao/noticia/2015/08/empresario-diz-que-cria-17-casais-de-sacis-em-sitio-eles-aprontam-muito.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Empres&aacute;rio diz que cria 17 casais de sacis em s&iacute;tio: 'Eles aprontam muito' </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://g1.globo.com/sao-paulo/itapetininga-regiao/noticia/2015/08/empresario-diz-que-cria-17-casais-de-sacis-em-sitio-eles-aprontam-muito.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://g1.globo.com/sao-paulo/itapetininga-regiao/noticia/2015/08/empresario-diz-que-cria-17-casais-de-sacis-em-sitio-eles-aprontam-muito.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Edson Wagner &eacute; integrante da Associa&ccedil;&atilde;o Nacional dos Criadores de Saci. Porangaba tamb&eacute;m possui a lenda da maldi&ccedil;&atilde;o de 100 anos de uma cigana. </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;Entrepreneur says he breeds 17 couples of <a href=\"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/505b5bbde4b0cc7a6a483468/t/560acffae4b0a8188e87cb52/1443549180247/Evil+Saci+Low.png\" target=\"_blank\">Sacis</a>. 'they're quite mischievous'&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T11:16:00-08:00","id":1053904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karlgust</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1053699#post1053699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, this should be Vulgar even in our world.<br /> <br /> I guess after all those publications, I'll have to be a lot more lenient with vulgar effects</div> </div> </div> </div>Funnily enough, the Paperfuge is based heavily on a toy from India, called the Whirligig. A toy whose design dates back thousands of years. And when they measured it, it turned out it spins the disk at the center <i>really really fast</i> (that's a scientific term). Given that centrifuges work by spinning samples really really fast, it was inevitable that the two technologies would be combined, so long as there exists economic incentive to do so. It worked for the printing press, which Mage: The Sorcerer's Crusade maintains was probably an invention by sleepers (Gutenberg and his team), created from several existing technologies. As such, there is precedence for this in WoD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T12:04:09-08:00","id":1053933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1053766#post1053766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This one is more general wod than mage, but I guess it counts.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://g1.globo.com/mato-grosso-do-sul/noticia/2017/02/mulher-e-atacada-moradores-falam-em-lobisomem-e-pm-faz-buscas.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fa