-sacis-em-sitio-eles-aprontam-muito.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://g1.globo.com/sao-paulo/itapetininga-regiao/noticia/2015/08/empresario-diz-que-cria-17-casais-de-sacis-em-sitio-eles-aprontam-muito.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Edson Wagner &eacute; integrante da Associa&ccedil;&atilde;o Nacional dos Criadores de Saci. Porangaba tamb&eacute;m possui a lenda da maldi&ccedil;&atilde;o de 100 anos de uma cigana. </div> </div> </div><br /> &amp;quot;Entrepreneur says he breeds 17 couples of <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/505b5bbde4b0cc7a6a483468/t/560acffae4b0a8188e87cb52/1443549180247/Evil+Saci+Low.png&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">Sacis</a>. 'they're quite mischievous'&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, those are here in Brazil. Considering my grampa once &quot;captured&quot; a &quot;werewolf&quot;... Well...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:09:16-08:00","id":1053998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karlgust</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1053699#post1053699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, this should be Vulgar even in our world.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Consensus is shifting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:15:43-08:00","id":1054002,"title":"","content":"How about this? <a href=\"http://edition.cnn.com/2017/01/04/health/new-organ-mesentery/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://edition.cnn.com/2017/01/04/he...ery/index.html</a><br /> <br /> The organ you didn't know you had!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:31:01-08:00","id":1054013,"title":"","content":"Of course the Consensus is shifting. It's constantly shifting, and indeed is shifting faster and faster nowadays, with the seemingly inexorable march of Science. Back in the 90s, self-driving cars were a pipe dream of SF. Now autonomous vehicles, and the services that revolve around them, are moving into use so quickly, <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/2017/02/congress-give-self-driving-cars-happen-ruin-everything/\" target=\"_blank\">federal regulation isn't equipped to handle it</a>. In the 90s, robots that served you coffee were science fiction. Now, we not only have <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/2017/01/cafe-x-robot-barista/\" target=\"_blank\">barista-bots</a>, but they can <i>teach themselves</i> how to perform tasks. In the 90s, the only thing resembling a cure for cancer was protracted treatment sessions, where you got radiation pumped into you, in the hopes that radiation killed your cancer before it killed you. Now, Immunotherapy drugs is not just a theoretical possibility, but an <a href=\"http://www.cancercenter.com/discussions/blog/fda-approves-immunotherapy-drugs-to-treat-more-cancer-types/\" target=\"_blank\">approved treatment for many kinds of cancers</a>, with more drugs on the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:32:19-08:00","id":1054014,"title":"","content":"I remember this story with Jodi Blake &amp; Penny Dreadful where it mentioned a black cat (the magical kind) were black all the way down to the bones. I didn't think much of that statement until I saw this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.viralforest.com/cemani-chickens/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.viralforest.com/cemani-chickens/\" target=\"_blank\"> 404 Not Found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.viralforest.com/cemani-chickens/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.viralforest.com/cemani-chickens/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"