stroyed by Disbelief because the locals assumed someone painted it. Obviously because it got washed off, this story was true (unless, of course, the Technocracy came in and fiddled with its DNA, then modified folks' memories so they <i>thought</i> they'd washed the cat). Still, I wouldn't be surprised if, by the power of Memes, there isn't an Emerald Cat spirit running around the Umbra. Maybe hanging out with Nyancat, Longcat, and Hello Kitty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:59:56-08:00","id":1054034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1054026#post1054026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still, I wouldn't be surprised if, by the power of Memes, there isn't an Emerald Cat spirit running around the Umbra. Maybe hanging out with Nyancat, Longcat, and Hello Kitty.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now I know what to recruit if my VA mage ever needed an army<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","use