classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1056405#post1056405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some Hermetics, yeah. Hollow Ones, too. A few Virtual Adepts and Etherites, perhaps. Mostly assorted Orphans, since Chaos Magick is a largely open source style.<br /> <br /> I highly doubt any of the Traditions or Crafts would want to take ownership for a bunch of neo-Nazi white supremecists, though. Even the Verbana are over that biz, and some of their number were Vanilla Nazis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aren't traditionalists ALL nefandic nazis?<br /> <br /> At least that's what they told at the Academy 101...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T04:54:58-08:00","id":1056566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1056405#post1056405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some Hermetics, yeah. Hollow Ones, too. A few Virtual Adepts and Etherites, perhaps. Mostly assorted Orphans, since Chaos Magick is a largely open source style.<br /> <br /> I highly doubt any of the Traditions or Crafts would want to take ownership for a bunch of neo-Nazi white supremecists, though. Even the Verbana are over that biz, and some of their number were Vanilla Nazis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Meme magicians? VAs and Hermetics, I would think. Fighting against their counterparts in the NWO. And there's a lot of ways you could adapt this:<br /> <br /> -The Trads co-opted an idea first started by sleepers and haven't fully cleared it of it's baggage yet.<br /> <br /> -The NWO are pushing the narrative that the Traditions are associated with racists, because anything that undercuts their enemies...<br /> <br /> -The NWO are pushing the narrative that the meme is racist, because anything that undercuts their enemies...<br /> <br /> -The Trads don't care what the baggage is because the memes are just a means to an end anyways (a fight between the media and the government seems like it would help them, doesn't it?)<br /> <br /> -Some of the Traditionalists actually are racists, but the Traditions have dealt with deeper divides before (hell, if the Akashics and the Chakravanti can work together...)<br /> <br /> <br /> There really are endless possibilities depending on what makes for an interesting game and what is appropriate to you and your players.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T06:24:34-08:00","id":1056609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1056341#post1056341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like, seriously.<br /> <br /> What's more, these people are waging magical warfare with <a href=\"https://motherboard.vice.com/en_us/article/trumps-occult-online-supporters-believe-pepe-meme-magic-got-him-elected\" target=\"_blank\">Trump-supporting chaos magicians, and their appropriated sigil Pepe</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I thought the politics in my mage games were far fetched.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T07:00:28-08:00","id":1056617,"title":"","content":"Trump supporting chaos magicians vs. a loosely formed group of incanters calling itself the Magical Resistance (that wants to &quot;Bind&quot; trump like you would bind a demon maybe?) sounds like one of those multi-tradition squabbles that leave the technocracy wondering what the heck started all this and wanting to just end everyone involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T11:51:24-08:00","id":1056713,"title":"","content":"And more on Kek<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/pepe.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> The Truth About Pepe The Frog And The Cult Of Kek </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> I&rsquo;ll cut right to the chase: Pepe the Frog isn&rsquo;t a white nationalist symbol. Pepe the Frog isn&rsquo;t a harmless meme propagated by teenagers on the internet. Pepe the Frog is, in fact, the modern-day avatar of&nbsp;an ancient Egyptian deity accidentally&nbsp;resurrected&nbsp;by online imageboard culture.&nbsp; Does that sound like the most b@tsh#t crazy thing you&rsquo;ve ever&hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.files.wordpress.com/2016/09/esoteric-kekism2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">https://pepethefrogfaith.files.wordp...ic-kekism2.jpg</a><br /> Ancient Egyptian Virtual Adepts!!!<br /> <br /> (What if this whole thing was the unpredicted effect of a distress signal by a virtual adept who got stuck in ancient egypt?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 03-01-2017, 03:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T12:35:28-08:00","id":1056737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mentalfloss.com/article/87536/japanese-baseball-team-cursed-ghost-colonel-sanders\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_fill,w_1440,ar_1440:810,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/shape/cover/sport/346464646-9903142b3b96b5bacbe6a9526dd65ae4.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mentalfloss.com/article/87536/japanese-baseball-team-cursed-ghost-colonel-sanders\" target=\"_blank\"> The Japanese Baseball Team Cursed by the Ghost of Colonel Sanders </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mentalfloss.com/article/87536/japanese-baseball-team-cursed-ghost-colonel-sanders\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mentalfloss.com/article/87536/japanese-baseball-team-cursed-ghost-colonel-sanders </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Yes, the KFC guy. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I played this mage game once where another player became a priest of colonel sanders so that colonel sanders would curse our enemies. We had to fish up the missing hand and glasses (They were missing at the time) and consequently our cabal had KFC at least one meal a day, mainly because the PC would force it on our characters at every meeting and the PCs generally didn't want to waste food.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T13:14:07-08:00","id":1056759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1056713#post1056713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And more on Kek<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/pepe.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> The Truth About Pepe The Frog And The Cult Of Kek </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://pepethefrogfaith.wordpress.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> I&rsquo;ll cut right to the chase: Pepe the Frog isn&rsquo;t a white nationalist symbol. Pepe the Frog isn&rsquo;t a harmless meme propagated by teenagers on the internet. Pepe the Frog is, in fact, the modern-day avatar of&nbsp;an ancient Egyptian deity accidentally&nbsp;resurrected&nbsp;by online imageboard culture.&nbsp; Does that sound like the most b@tsh#t crazy thing you&rsquo;ve ever&hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://pepethefrogfaith.files.wordpress.com/2016/09/esoteric-kekism2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">https://pepethefrogfaith.files.wordp...ic-kekism2.jpg</a><br /> Ancient Egyptian Virtual Adepts!!!<br /> <br /> (What if this whole thing was the unpredicted effect of a distress signal by a virtual adept who got stuck in ancient egypt?)</div> </div> </div> </div>No, it's just that modern chaos magicians are channeling the power of the most evil force in history: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/A0Z8r1DAYmg\" target=\"_blank\">ANCIENT EGYPT</a>!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T13:37:34-08:00","id":1056775,"title":"","content":"I am now imagining that guy from Ancient Aliens saying &quot;Ancient Egypt!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-01T17:23:43-08:00","id":1056872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1048249#post1048249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since when is Technocracy racist?</div> </div> </div> </div>The technocracy was founded by racists, have you read the source material?<br /> <br /> Only recently has the technocracy shed its racists values","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T01:59:03-08:00","id":1057027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1048388#post1048388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, it's not like terrorists ever existed. Wait, no, terrorists totally exist and the Traditions are in exactly that position. In fact, it's much easier for the Traditions to leverage terrorism for power considering that the goal of Technocracy is to slowly make everyone a mage by shifting the consensus and the goal of Traditions is to make people believe in magic again so that hermetics can go back to their towers and feudal villages. Technocrats don't get anything out of committing atrocities. It's not helpful to their goals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you even read the convention books????<br /> <br /> Revised or old, the technocracy tortures people, enclaves them and sometimes turns them into cyborg killing machines against their will!!!<br /> <br /> You have totally lost sight of what the Union is and isn't.<br /> <br /> No offence to you Kammerer but the source material is fairly clear on this, if you have another interpretation that you would like to propose then I suggest you make it clear you are using your own version of the technocracy in your examples.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T03:49:30-08:00","id":1057040,"title":"","content":"I love the binding circle story, but no one posted that there was a <a href=\"http://theweek.com/speedreads/681860/there-going-witch-spell-vs-christian-prayer-showdown-over-trumps-mortal-fate\" target=\"_blank\">Christian prayer countermagick</a> ritual, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T04:50:10-08:00","id":1057047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zennis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1057027#post1057027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Have you even read the convention books????<br /> <br /> Revised or old, the technocracy tortures people, enclaves them and sometimes turns them into cyborg killing machines against their will!!!<br /> <br /> You have totally lost sight of what the Union is and isn't.<br /> <br /> No offence to you Kammerer but the source material is fairly clear on this, if you have another interpretation that you would like to propose then I suggest you make it clear you are using your own version of the technocracy in your examples.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you bother to read the rest of the thread? We were talking about large scale public atrocities, like mass sacrifice or genocide. The kind that gets noticed by the public. Not the &quot;torture people in a secret prison&quot; kind of atrocities.<br /> <br /> And as for the other post, what makes you say that? Let's go through the original factions in the Order of Reason. <i>Artificers</i> are a meritocracy that grew out of Egypt and Rome. Not buying the racism with them. <i>Cabal of Pure Thought</i> are christian fanatics. I can buy them being racist, but this being a 14th century I think they'd care more about your religion than your skin color. There were christian arabs after all, and quite a lot of them. <i>Celestial Masters</i>. Grow out of egypt and babylon. Could be racist, but no evidence given. In fact, the opposite is more likely as the Void Engineers are the designated good guy faction in the Technocracy. <i>Craftmasons</i>. Split from the Order of Hermes because they wanted to share magic with everyone instead of hoarding it. Communists and meritocrats. Don't really sound like racists. <i>High guild</i>. Explicitly had African and Middle Eastern members. Hippocratic Circle. No evidence given either way. <i>Solificati</i>. No evidence given either way, but most likely heavily used arabic texts on account of being alchemists.<br /> <br /> So, sorry, but other than screaming &quot;Order of Reason was founded by racists!&quot; you haven't presented any arguments. Not all white people are racists. And we are talking about 14th century here. The concept of race and racism as we know it haven't been invented yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12892,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","user":"Kammerer","date":". 03-02-2017, 07:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T07:35:15-08:00","id":1057082,"title":"","content":"I think we're operating on two definitions. Sure, the Order of Reason was founded on what was liberal principles at the time, but it was still a form of Colonialism. Our standards and values have changed. <br /> <br /> Anyway, Zennis, we'd moved on from this part of the conversation. It's never gonna heal if we keep picking at it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T10:50:56-08:00","id":1057153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zennis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1056872#post1056872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The technocracy was founded by racists, have you read the source material?<br /> <br /> Only recently has the technocracy shed its racists values</div> </div> </div> </div>[Citation needed]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I seem to have acquired a site for running play by post games. This is unexpected and frightening and come watch either the glorious play or the magnificent train wreck:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">The Malkavian Madness Network</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1515-benjcano","name":"BenjCano","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-02T15:41:09-08:00","id":1057296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GogariGlenRoss</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1057082#post1057082\"