ites must be ecstatic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T06:55:16-07:00","id":1086175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1048017-mage-in-the-real-world?p=1082111#post1082111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh hey, look at this <a href=\"https://futurism.com/a-real-life-all-electric-flying-car-just-took-off/\" target=\"_blank\">all-electric flying car that just did its first successful test flight</a>.<br /> <br /> So we can stop asking where our flying cars are now. It's right there, waiting to complete testing. Apparently, Uber is also <a href=\"https://futurism.com/uber-plans-to-take-ridesharing-to-the-skies-meet-the-vtol-flying-car/\" target=\"_blank\">planning its own vertical takeoff and landing aircraft</a>, similarly all-electric.<br /> <br /> Pretty soon, flying cars will be coincidental. Perhaps it already is, given that successful test. Etherites must be ecstatic.</div> </div> </div> </div>This can s