ike a form of Iteration X superscience research that has the potential of making both NWO controlfreaks and Syndicate businessman very happy).<br /> Really, it was bound to happen. Etherites just were doing it before it was cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T06:55:01-07:00","id":1118939,"title":"","content":"I needed to raise this thread from the dead, because <a href=\"http://www.bbc.co.uk/news/amp/40680945\" target=\"_blank\">a crocodile in Indonesia returned the body of a man after a &quot;crocodile charmer&quot; performed a mystic ritual</a>.<br /> <br /> 'Nuff said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-22T00:22:01-07:00","id":1119199,"title":"","content":"More like a technology evolution than a revolution, but still...baffling and good for another 'vulgar technology becoming coincidental' adjustment:<br /> <br /> Intel unveilved an <a href=\"https://newsroom.intel.com/news/intel-democratizes-deep-learning-application-development-launch-movidius-